    {
      "id": "claim_95cf7df2a7c5469f999272fecabe95a1",
      "statement": "`PairedFidelitySpec.build` forwards `ctx.datamodule` as the paired-subset source so the built callback resolves the paired validation dataset lazily at the first gated epoch (`getattr(datamodule, \"val_latent_ds\", datamodule)`, F5), and the monitor stays observe-only: its `logged_metrics` make `val/psnr` / `val/ssim` validatable monitors for `validate_monitor` while the supervised shell keeps the checkpoint monitor on `val/x0_mae`.",
