    {
      "id": "claim_29ef22ad44524056beb75baaa1a7a0af",
      "statement": "`build_trainer` appends the non-registry framework callbacks — the spt `ModuleRegistryCallback` and the `MetricsPlotCallback` — and the metrics plot callback renders every finite metric found in the CSV logger's `metrics.csv` as its own subplot, so a newly logged metric such as `val/psnr` / `val/ssim` appears in the metrics PNG without any special-casing.",
