      "statement": "`resolve_callback_names` resolves the callback-name list with CLI-over-YAML list-replace semantics: a comma-separated `--callbacks` string replaces the YAML `callbacks:` list, and `None` is returned when neither is supplied so the shell keeps its derived default name set.",
